    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Instant Lead Response & Triage\n\n**Problem it solves:** inbound leads sit in an inbox for hours. Speed-to-lead is the single biggest lever on conversion for SMBs.\n\n**What it does**\n1. Catches any web form / lead-ad submission via webhook\n2. Normalises messy field names into one schema\n3. Checks the Leads sheet so repeat contacts don't get a cold intro\n4. Uses an LLM to score, tag and draft a real reply\n5. Routes: HOT -> Slack + SMS + instant email · WARM -> instant email · SPAM -> logged only\n6. Waits 24h, checks Gmail for a reply, sends one polite nudge if silent\n\n**Setup (15 min)**\n- Create a Google Sheet named `Leads` with headers:\n  `Lead ID | Received At | Name | Email | Phone | Company | Service | Budget | Source | Message | Grade | Score | Urgency | Summary | Next Step | Status`\n- Paste the Sheet ID into both Google Sheets nodes\n- Set credentials on: Google Sheets, OpenAI, Gmail, Slack, Twilio\n- Edit the SYSTEM PROMPT in `AI Qualify Lead` with your business name, services and pricing guardrails\n- Replace `+15550000000` in the Twilio node with the on-call rep's mobile\n- Replace the signature block in both Gmail reply nodes\n- Point your form at the production webhook URL (POST)",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-820, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Test payload\nPOST this to the webhook to try it:\n```\n{\n  \"first_name\": \"Dana\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Rivera\",\n  \"Email Address\": \"dana@acmedental.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"+19735551234\",\n  \"company\": \"Acme Dental\",\n  \"service\": \"HVAC replacement\",\n  \"budget\": \"$12,000\",\n  \"timeline\": \"next 2 weeks\",\n  \"message\": \"Our rooftop unit failed and the office is 84 degrees. Need a quote ASAP, we have 3 quotes already.\"\n}\n```",
